## PR Trigger Configuration

- Target main and dev branches
- Workflow run completion triggers
- Manual workflow dispatch support
- Branch protection rule integration
- Quality gate enforcement automatic
- Review requirement coordination

```yaml
# PR workflow triggers
on:
  pull_request:
    branches:
      - main
      - dev
  workflow_dispatch:
```

## Pre-Review Automation

- Cache preparation job execution
- Flutter SDK caching implementation
- Pub dependencies optimization
- Dart analysis pre-warming
- 15-minute timeout for preparation
- Parallel job execution setup

## Integration Testing Pipeline

- Android emulator setup automation
- KVM permissions configuration
- AVD snapshot caching strategy
- API level 30 standard
- Hardware acceleration optimization
- Headless execution for reliability

```yaml
# Android emulator setup
- name: Enable KVM group perms
  run: |
    echo 'KERNEL=="kvm", GROUP="kvm", MODE="0666"' | sudo tee /etc/udev/rules.d/99-kvm4all.rules
    sudo udevadm control --reload-rules
```

