## Issue Creation Workflow

- Create GitHub issue with clear title and description
- Add issue to project board immediately after creation
- Set status to "Backlog" column by default
- Use GitHub GraphQL API for project automation
- Label appropriately (enhancement, bug, etc.)

```bash
# Add newly created issue to project in Backlog column
gh api graphql -f query='
  mutation {
    addProjectV2ItemById(
      input: {
        projectId: "PVT_kwHOAA1yyM4BDBcz"
        contentId: "ISSUE_NODE_ID"
      }
    ) {
      item {
        id
      }
    }
  }
' | jq -r '.data.addProjectV2ItemById.item.id' | \
xargs -I {} gh api graphql -f query='
  mutation {
    updateProjectV2ItemFieldValue(
      input: {
        projectId: "PVT_kwHOAA1yyM4BDBcz"
        itemId: "{}"
        fieldId: "PVTSSF_lAHOAA1yyM4BDBczzg1ECH4"
        value: { singleSelectOptionId: "f75ad846" }
      }
    ) {
      projectV2Item { id }
    }
  }
'
```

## Starting Work on Issue

- Move issue from "Backlog" to "In Progress" when starting work
- Create feature branch following naming convention
- Update project board status automatically
- Link commits to issue number

```bash
# Move issue to In Progress column when starting work
gh api graphql -f query='
  mutation {
    updateProjectV2ItemFieldValue(
      input: {
        projectId: "PVT_kwHOAA1yyM4BDBcz"
        itemId: "ITEM_ID"
        fieldId: "PVTSSF_lAHOAA1yyM4BDBczzg1ECH4"
        value: { singleSelectOptionId: "47fc9ee4" }
      }
    ) {
      projectV2Item { id }
    }
  }
'
```

## PR Creation Workflow

- Create PR with descriptive title and body
- Link to related issue using "Closes #XX"
- Move associated issue to "Review" column in project board
- Use GitHub GraphQL API for project automation
- Ensure PR targets correct base branch
- Push branch to remote before PR creation

```bash
# Move issue to Review column after PR creation
gh api graphql -f query='
  mutation {
    updateProjectV2ItemFieldValue(
      input: {
        projectId: "PVT_kwHOAA1yyM4BDBcz"
        itemId: "ITEM_ID"
        fieldId: "PVTSSF_lAHOAA1yyM4BDBczzg1ECH4"
        value: { singleSelectOptionId: "7ce3d9b0" }
      }
    ) {
      projectV2Item { id }
    }
  }
'
```

